{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24982","headline":"沈存尚林亭夜宴 · 牟融","name":"沈存尚林亭夜宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂寂寂景偏幽，到此令人一纵眸。\n松菊寒香三径晚，桑榆烟景两淮秋。\n近山红叶堆林屋，隔浦青帘拂画楼。\n终日忘情能自乐，清尊应得遣闲愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}